WEBVTT

00:01:59.663 --> 00:02:04.288
that he is the one who shapes you in the
room as he pleases and of his signs.

00:02:04.288 --> 00:02:06.663
It's the creation of the heavens
and the earth and

00:02:06.663 --> 00:02:08.871
the differences of your
tongues and colors.

00:02:10.621 --> 00:02:11.621
The first time I read that,

00:02:11.621 --> 00:02:13.996
it was the first time I could
hold the Koran without

00:02:13.996 --> 00:02:17.996
an urge to repel it here it
was in this ancient text,

00:02:18.246 --> 00:02:21.913
the idea that difference and variance
was all part of Ali's plan.

00:02:22.329 --> 00:02:24.579
Maybe Allah treats human
beings in the same way.

00:02:24.579 --> 00:02:29.329
I love to think about marine aquatics as
a kind of collection of interchanging,

00:02:29.329 --> 00:02:33.329
formless bodies that all coexist
as one colorful mass.